      "message": "Let a person pick four landed changes to show, each with a line\n\nEverything else on a person's page is counted from the log. Picked is\nthe one place they tell a story, about things that landed: up to four\nof their own changes, in the order they choose, each with a line of\ntheirs. One event carries the whole list every time (ProfilePicked), a\nprojection holds it, and picking a change that is not theirs, has not\nlanded, or is named twice is refused with the reason. The section sits\nunder Standing on the Overview; /you/picks is where they choose, four\nslots of their landed changes with a line each; the API has it at\nGET and PUT /api/you/picks, and whois carries it.\n\nSchema 39, with the three shape pins moved.\n\nChange-Id: Ipicked0170\nTask: t-6dmxbvw93wv33ztja80ax80nde\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
